      "dcterms:title": "Octahedral coordinates from the Wirtinger presentation",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "McPhail-Snyder, Calvin"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20250516",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.19155",
      "dcterms:abstract": "Let ρ be a representation of a knot group (or more generally, the funda- mental group of a tangle complement) into SL2(C) expressed in terms of the Wirtinger generators of a diagram D. This diagram also determines an ideal triangulation of the complement called the octahedral decompo- sition. ρ induces a hyperbolic structure on the complement of D, and in this note we give a direct algebraic formula for the geometric parameters of the octahedral decomposition induced by this structure. Our formula gives a new, explicit criterion for whether ρ occurs as a critical point of the diagram’s Neumann-Zagier–Yokota potential function.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-2404.19155v2/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/arxiv-2404.19155v2"
    }
  ]
